      "outerHTML": "<button role=\"none\">",
      "reason": "The button element has an empty accessible name, violating the requirement for buttons to have non-empty, descriptive accessible names. Additionally, setting role=\"none\" on a native interactive element is invalid as it removes its semantic role.",
      "recommendation": "Remove the role=\"none\" attribute to restore the native button role, and provide a descriptive accessible name using inner text, an aria-label attribute, or an aria-labelledby attribute."
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The button element violates WCAG SC 4.1.2 because it lacks an accessible name and incorrectly overrides its semantic role with role=\"none\"."
}

